{"lines":{"10":{"character":"","next_id":"11","replacements":[],"text":"Leonnie est en effet chargé de décorer la ville pour Halloween, avec ses somptueuses citrouilles !","type":"dialogue"},"100":{"condition":null,"next_id":"101","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":["100"],"text":"Aller voir en ville","type":"response"},"101":{"character":"","next_id":"102","replacements":[],"text":"Léonnie, furibonde, part d'un pas décidé vers la ville pour tirer cette affaire au clair.","type":"dialogue"},"102":{"next_id":"108","type":"goto"},"103":{"condition":null,"next_id":"104","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Aller voir en ville","type":"response"},"104":{"character":"","next_id":"105","replacements":[],"text":"Léonnie, furibonde, part d'un pas décidé vers la ville pour tirer cette affaire au clair.","type":"dialogue"},"105":{"next_id":"108","type":"goto"},"108":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":[],"lhs_function":"remove_all_chars","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"109","type":"mutation"},"109":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"ville\""],"lhs_function":"change_backgrounds","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"110","type":"mutation"},"11":{"next_id":"14","type":"goto"},"110":{"character":"","next_id":"111","replacements":[],"text":"Devant Léonnie se dresse une petite apocalypse.","type":"dialogue"},"111":{"character":"","next_id":"112","replacements":[],"text":"Des citrouilles partout ! Dans la rue, par les fenêtres...","type":"dialogue"},"112":{"character":"","next_id":"113","replacements":[],"text":"Les cucurbitacés semble s'être répamdus dans toute la ville !","type":"dialogue"},"113":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"114","replacements":[],"text":"Oh là là... Le Fantôme ne mentait pas !","type":"dialogue"},"114":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"115","replacements":[],"text":"Je peux choisir d'hyperventiler, ou bien réfléchir au problème...","type":"dialogue"},"115":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"116","replacements":[],"text":"Pourquoi pas les deux à la fois ? Non, voyons, respirons un bon coup.","type":"dialogue"},"116":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"117","replacements":[],"text":"Fantôme a dit qu'il avait du mal à se souvenir de quelque chose.","type":"dialogue"},"117":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"118","replacements":[],"text":"Donc, on sait qu'il s'est passé quelque chose !","type":"dialogue"},"118":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"119","replacements":[],"text":"Je connais deux zigotos qui auraient probablement des réponses.","type":"dialogue"},"119":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"120","replacements":[],"text":"Je peux aller voir le Maire, toujours en train de manigancer quelque chose.","type":"dialogue"},"120":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"121","replacements":[],"text":"Et aussi Vampire, pas le dernier pour semer la zizanie !","type":"dialogue"},"121":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"122","replacements":[],"text":"Je vais commencer par...","type":"dialogue"},"122":{"condition":null,"next_id":"123","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":["122","124"],"text":"Aller voir le Maire","type":"response"},"123":{"next_id":"128","type":"goto"},"124":{"condition":null,"next_id":"125","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Aller voir Vampire","type":"response"},"125":{"next_id":"206","type":"goto"},"128":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"ville\""],"lhs_function":"change_backgrounds","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"129","type":"mutation"},"129":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":[],"lhs_function":"remove_all_chars","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"130","type":"mutation"},"130":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"maire 40 20 0.7\""],"lhs_function":"spawn_char","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"131","type":"mutation"},"131":{"condition":{"lhs":"hasMaireIndice","lhs_type":"scalar","operator":"==","rhs":[{"type":"value","value":"false"}],"rhs_type":"scalar"},"next_conditional_id":"147","next_id":"132","next_id_after":"149","type":"condition"},"132":{"character":"","next_id":"133","replacements":[],"text":"Le Maire du village est un joyeux luron. Parfois trop joyeux.","type":"dialogue"},"133":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"134","replacements":[],"text":"Ah Lélé ! Ca fait plaisir de te voir !","type":"dialogue"},"134":{"character":"","next_id":"135","replacements":[],"text":"Il a une facheuse tendance à donner des surnoms éclatés aux gens.","type":"dialogue"},"135":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"136","replacements":[],"text":"Haha, oui... Bonjour Maire.","type":"dialogue"},"136":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"137","replacements":[],"text":"Dis-donc Ninie, vous avez eu la main lourde cette année sur la potion !","type":"dialogue"},"137":{"character":"","next_id":"138","replacements":[],"text":"Léonnie fulmine.","type":"dialogue"},"138":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"139","replacements":[],"text":"Vous savez quoi ? Si vous réglez ça avant Halloween...","type":"dialogue"},"139":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"140","replacements":[],"text":"Je vous invite au resto ! Qu'est-ce que vous en dites ? Ca ne se refuse pas !","type":"dialogue"},"14":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":[],"lhs_function":"remove_all_chars","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"15","type":"mutation"},"140":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"141","replacements":[],"text":"(Je veux disparaître...)","type":"dialogue"},"141":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"142","replacements":[],"text":"Ou alors, on disait qu'il n'y aurait pas de resto en échange ? Hein ?","type":"dialogue"},"142":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"143","replacements":[],"text":"Haha, Lénou quel humour ! J'adore !","type":"dialogue"},"143":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"144","replacements":[],"text":"(On règlera ça plus tard...)","type":"dialogue"},"144":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"145","replacements":[],"text":"Passons, j'aurais voulu vous poser quelques question m'sieur le Maire.","type":"dialogue"},"145":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"146","replacements":[],"text":"Mais bien sûr Nilou ! Pour vous j'ai toujours le temps !","type":"dialogue"},"146":{"next_id":"155","type":"goto"},"147":{"condition":null,"next_conditional_id":"149","next_id":"148","next_id_after":"149","type":"condition"},"148":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"149","replacements":[],"text":"Notre ami Fantôme est louche, c'est moi qui vous le dit !","type":"dialogue"},"149":{"condition":null,"next_id":"150","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":["149","151"],"text":"Retourner voir Fantôme","type":"response"},"15":{"condition":{"lhs":"hasDrinkTea","lhs_type":"scalar","operator":"==","rhs":[{"type":"value","value":"false"}],"rhs_type":"scalar"},"next_conditional_id":"17","next_id":"16","next_id_after":"21","type":"condition"},"150":{"next_id":"223","type":"goto"},"151":{"condition":null,"next_id":"152","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Aller voir Vampire","type":"response"},"152":{"next_id":"206","type":"goto"},"155":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":[],"lhs_function":"remove_all_chars","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"156","type":"mutation"},"156":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"maire 35 15 0.85\""],"lhs_function":"spawn_char","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"157","type":"mutation"},"157":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"158","replacements":[],"text":"De quoi vouliez-vous parler ?","type":"dialogue"},"158":{"condition":null,"next_id":"159","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":["158","163","195","201"],"text":"Parler beau temps","type":"response"},"159":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"160","replacements":[],"text":"Beau temps n'est-ce pas ? L'Automne, le soleil...","type":"dialogue"},"16":{"character":"","next_id":"21","replacements":[],"text":"Mais rien ne presse...","type":"dialogue"},"160":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"161","replacements":[],"text":"Les citrouilles qui se baladent... Vous êtes sûre de ne rien pouvoir faire à ce sujet ?","type":"dialogue"},"161":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"162","replacements":[],"text":"Oui, bon... Parlons d'autre chose.","type":"dialogue"},"162":{"next_id":"155","type":"goto"},"163":{"condition":null,"next_id":"164","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Parler voyages","type":"response"},"164":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"165","replacements":[],"text":"J'ai entendu dire que vous étiez féru de voyages !","type":"dialogue"},"165":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"166","replacements":[],"text":"Ah oui ? Qui vous en a parlé ?","type":"dialogue"},"166":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"167","replacements":[],"text":"Vous, à chaque fois que je vous croise. Vous parlez beaucoup de vous.","type":"dialogue"},"167":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"168","replacements":[],"text":"Haha ! Je pourrais croire que vous vous lassez de nos conversations !","type":"dialogue"},"168":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"169","replacements":[],"text":"Heureusement que je vous connais.","type":"dialogue"},"169":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"170","replacements":[],"text":"Oui, heureusement...","type":"dialogue"},"17":{"condition":null,"next_conditional_id":"21","next_id":"18","next_id_after":"21","type":"condition"},"170":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"171","replacements":[],"text":"Vous aimez loger chez l'habitant, me semble-t-il ?","type":"dialogue"},"171":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"172","replacements":[],"text":"Rien de mieux pour apprécier pleinement  la région que l'on visite !","type":"dialogue"},"172":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"173","replacements":[],"text":"Et la prochaine fois, vous pourriez me demander avant de rentrer chez moi ?","type":"dialogue"},"173":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"174","replacements":[],"text":"Que ?! Enfin Lélé... On se connait mieux que ça !","type":"dialogue"},"174":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"175","replacements":[],"text":"Vous jurez ne pas être venu chez moi pendant mon absence ?","type":"dialogue"},"175":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"176","replacements":[],"text":"Alors là, croix de bois croix de fer, si je mens je vais en enfer !","type":"dialogue"},"176":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"177","replacements":[],"text":"Bon, étant un squelette ça ne m'engage pas trop, mais ma parole est ma parole !","type":"dialogue"},"177":{"condition":null,"next_id":"178","next_id_after":"185","replacements":[],"responses":["177","180"],"text":"S'excuser","type":"response"},"178":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"179","replacements":[],"text":"Très bien, je vous crois... Désolé d'avoir douté de vous.","type":"dialogue"},"179":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"185","replacements":[],"text":"Haha ! Ce n'est rien. D'autant que...","type":"dialogue"},"18":{"character":"","next_id":"19","replacements":[],"text":"Rien ne presse, donc...","type":"dialogue"},"180":{"condition":null,"next_id":"181","next_id_after":"185","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Pester","type":"response"},"181":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"182","replacements":[],"text":"Mais il s'est passé quelque chose !","type":"dialogue"},"182":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"183","replacements":[],"text":"Je ne rate pas mes potions moi monsieur !","type":"dialogue"},"183":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"184","replacements":[],"text":"Voyons Ninie, j'ai mes défauts mais je n'aime pas mentir.","type":"dialogue"},"184":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"185","replacements":[],"text":"D'autant que vous n'avez pas tort.","type":"dialogue"},"185":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"186","replacements":[],"text":"Quelqu'un est effectivement passé chez vous.","type":"dialogue"},"186":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"187","replacements":[],"text":"Comment ?! Qui donc ??","type":"dialogue"},"187":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"hasMaireIndice\""],"lhs_function":"toggle_state","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"188","type":"mutation"},"188":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"189","replacements":[],"text":"Notre ami tout de drap vêtu ! Je ne sais pas quel projet menait-il.","type":"dialogue"},"189":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"190","replacements":[],"text":"Fantôme est entré chez moi ?? Mais pourquoi donc ?!","type":"dialogue"},"19":{"condition":null,"next_id":"20","next_id_after":"20","replacements":[],"responses":["19"],"text":"Aller voir les citrouilles","type":"response"},"190":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"191","replacements":[],"text":"C'est un mystère dont je serais ravi de discuter autour de chandelles, Lélé !","type":"dialogue"},"191":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"192","replacements":[],"text":"Mais quel enfer...","type":"dialogue"},"192":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"193","replacements":[],"text":"Encore un surnom, Maire, et il faudra une fouille archéologique pour retrouver tous vos os !","type":"dialogue"},"193":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"194","replacements":[],"text":"Mais, enfin...","type":"dialogue"},"194":{"next_id":"128","type":"goto"},"195":{"condition":null,"next_id":"196","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Parler tendances","type":"response"},"196":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"197","replacements":[],"text":"Il parait que les Pin's sont de retour à la mode !","type":"dialogue"},"197":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"198","replacements":[],"text":"Oui, moi-même j'en ai un à mon effigie. Je l'adore !","type":"dialogue"},"198":{"character":"Léonnie","next_id":"199","replacements":[],"text":"C'est vous que vous adorez, Maire.","type":"dialogue"},"199":{"character":"Maire","next_id":"200","replacements":[],"text":"Eh bien... Oui, c'est juste !","type":"dialogue"},"2":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":[],"lhs_function":"remove_all_chars","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"3","type":"mutation"},"20":{"next_id":"32","type":"goto"},"200":{"next_id":"155","type":"goto"},"201":{"condition":null,"next_id":"202","next_id_after":"","replacements":[],"responses":[],"text":"Aller voir Vampire","type":"response"},"202":{"next_id":"206","type":"goto"},"206":{"mutation":{"lhs_args":["\"ville\""],"lhs_function":"change_backgrounds","lhs_type":"function"},"next_id":"207","type":"mutation"},"207":{"mutation":{"lh